From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:05:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: no LineageOS contributors, statistics or Trust
 branding

LineageOS rows in Settings are rebranded or hidden; the legal notices
stay.

* Contributors: the About phone tile is gone (no IA_SETTINGS action on
  the ContributorsCloudFragment alias) and the part is not indexed.
* Statistics: the LineageOS statistics opt-in row leaves the Trust page
  and the part is not indexed. Collection stays off (lineage-sdk
  default def_stats_collection=false; Setup never writes it).
* Trust: the page and its tile are "Security status" (SELinux, patches,
  encryption, Restrict USB, SMS limit, alerts are unchanged). The Trust
  onboarding paragraph and shield leave the page; the onboarding and
  security-patch texts no longer say Trust or LineageOS, and their
  translations are dropped so every locale shows the new English text.
